@* The catalog's source as pages name it: those credited for its data as links, joined with "and" ("TVmaze", "Wikidata and
   Wikipedia"), or the source's plain name when nobody is (the invented development catalog). The footer, the terms
   and people's pages all use it. Each link and its separator are one line of markup, so no stray space lands before
   whatever punctuation follows the component. *@
@{ var credits = Brand.Catalog.Credits; }
@if (credits.Count == 0)
{
    @Brand.Catalog.Name
}
@for (var i = 0; i < credits.Count; i++)
{
    @(i > 0 ? " and " : "")<a href="@credits[i].Url" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@credits[i].Name</a>
}
